No molecular test results are reported; 
Mitotic activity is described as 10 to 20 mitoses per 10 HPF (score=2); 
There is no mention of treatment effect, regression score, or therapy response; 
Additional findings include a 0.7 x 0.3 cm biopsy cavity containing collagen material and a small metal clip as well as adjacent focal hemorrhage, and poorly-defined areas of blue staining.

